#. module: analitix
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:analitix.view_value_report_form
msgid ""
"<b>Recovered revenue is an estimate.</b> It is rescued\n"
"                        walk-outs multiplied by this store's own average sale,\n"
"                        and a rescued walk-out is one where an alert fired and\n"
"                        that same visit later produced a ticket — correlation,\n"
"                        stated honestly, not proof that the nudge caused the\n"
"                        sale. Inflating this figure is the fastest way to lose\n"
"                        the customer who eventually checks it."
msgstr ""

