#. module: analitix
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:analitix.view_store_form
msgid ""
"A <b>chime</b> is heard by whoever is nearby if the\n"
"                                    phone is not on silent, or if the alert lands on a\n"
"                                    back-office computer. Test it on the actual devices\n"
"                                    before you rely on it."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:analitix.view_store_form
msgid ""
"A <b>screen</b> message is read by the customer\n"
"                                    standing in front of it. Use it for something\n"
"                                    written <i>for</i> them — \"ask about our finance\n"
"                                    options\" — never for something <i>about</i> them."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:analitix.field_analitix_demographic__age_band
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:analitix.field_analitix_visitor__age_band
msgid ""
"A band, not an age. The underlying model outputs an estimate with real "
"error; reporting it to the year would present a guess as a measurement."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:analitix.action_visit_group
msgid ""
"A couple, a family, three friends — one buying decision. A store\n"
"                that counts a family of four as four visitors and one ticket\n"
"                reads a 25% conversion rate when the real figure was 100%."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:analitix.field_analitix_device__critical
msgid ""
"A critical device is one whose silence makes this store's numbers wrong: any"
" door counter, or the checkout camera. When it goes offline the technical "
"contacts are alerted. Clear the flag for a spare or experimental unit so it "
"does not page anyone at 3 a.m."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:analitix.action_visitor
msgid ""
"A crossing is what the camera sees; a visit is what the owner is\n"
"                asking about. Someone who steps out for a phone call and comes\n"
"                back is <b>one</b> visit — counting it as three would report a\n"
"                conversion rate a third of the truth."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:analitix.constraint_analitix_event_count_positive
msgid "A crossing must involve at least one person."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:analitix.field_analitix_store__offline_threshold_min
msgid ""
"A device that has not sent a heartbeat for this long is marked offline. "
"Raise it on stores with a flaky connection so a 90-second outage does not "
"page the technician every night."
msgstr ""

