"A revoked device is refused by the ingest endpoint immediately, without "
"waiting for anyone to reach the hardware."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:analitix.field_analitix_zone_dwell__served
msgid ""
"A salesperson attended them, either because the edge saw a staff face beside"
" them or because someone acknowledged the alert."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:analitix.field_analitix_lost_sale__was_served
msgid ""
"A salesperson did attend them and they still left. Kept, because 'we attend "
"them and they leave anyway' is a different and more expensive problem than "
"'nobody goes over'."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:analitix.view_store_form
msgid ""
"A screen saying \"Welcome back, Gustavo\" while\n"
"                                Gustavo is standing there with somebody has just\n"
"                                told that person something about him. With this\n"
"                                on, the screen stays neutral when he is not\n"
"                                alone and the personal greeting goes to the\n"
"                                salesperson instead."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:analitix.field_analitix_store__welcome_alone_only
msgid ""
"A screen that says 'Welcome back, Gustavo' while Gustavo is standing there "
"with somebody has just told that person something about him. When he is not "
"alone the screen stays neutral and the personal greeting goes to the "
"salesperson instead."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:analitix.field_analitix_store__attendance_max_hours
msgid ""
"A shift still open after this long is closed by the nightly job. Exits do "
"get missed, and an employee who appears to have worked fifty hours makes any"
" payroll reading it wrong."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:analitix.view_staff_signature_form
msgid ""
"A signature is a list of numbers produced from a face by\n"
"                        the enrolment tool. No photograph is stored here or\n"
"                        anywhere else in Analitix, and no image can be rebuilt\n"
"                        from it. It is encrypted in the database and its only\n"
"                        use is to keep this employee out of the visitor count."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:analitix.selection__analitix_signage_rule__target__fixed
msgid "A specific screen"
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:analitix.action_signage_rule
msgid ""
"A store has several screens and they are not interchangeable.\n"
"                Every rule resolves <b>where</b> before <b>what</b>: a bundle\n"
"                offer belongs on the screen the group is standing near, not on\n"
"                the one by the door."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:analitix.view_visitor_form
msgid ""
"A visit is pseudonymous. It points at an anonymous face\n"
"                        signature that expires on the store's retention schedule,\n"
"                        and carries no name and no image."
msgstr ""

#. module: analitix
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:analitix.field_analitix_store__max_visit_minutes
msgid ""
"A visit still open after this long is closed by the nightly cron. Exits do "
"get missed, and a visit left open forever quietly inflates the occupancy "
"figure until it is nonsense."
msgstr ""

